OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order issued for town
OL,4,Acentre on Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have issued a dispersal order in
OL,7,Fparts of Beeston for Halloween in a bid
OL,8,Fto prevent anti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said a dispersal
OL,11,Forder was in place across the town
OL,12,Fcentre, Broadgate Park and Dovecote
OL,13,FLane Recreation Ground from 15:00 on
OL,14,FSaturday to 03:00 GMT on Sunday.
OL,16,FThe order will give officers temporary
OL,17,Fpowers to remove people without
OL,18,Farresting them.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
