OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order issued for town
OL,4,Acentre on Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice added additional officers would
OL,7,Fbe on patrol "to remove any
OL,8,Ftroublemakers from the town centre and
OL,9,Frecreation ground".
